# Built artefacts under index/ ARE committed so the Space boots without
# re-fetching CFPB data — see "Deploying" in the README. Uncomment to keep the
# repo lean and build the index on first boot instead.
# index/

# …except the embedding matrix, which is a duplicate of the vectors already in
# complaints.faiss. It is reconstructed from the index at load time, and kept
# locally only to make `ingest --reuse-embeddings` fast.
index/embeddings.npy
